    "description": "To review your quest progression, select \u003Chex:024804F201F403\u003E\u003Chex:024904F201F503\u003EDuty\u003Chex:0249020103\u003E\u003Chex:0248020103\u003E from the main menu, followed by \u003Chex:024804F201F403\u003E\u003Chex:024904F201F503\u003EJournal\u003Chex:0249020103\u003E\u003Chex:0248020103\u003E.",
